  "question": {
    "text": "The value of the integral <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math> is equal to",
